# Implementation Plan - Hardening Security and Resolving Critical Bugs

We will implement complete end-to-end security hardening and fix critical functional gaps in the Vô Tri Club SMM Panel. This includes implementing an in-memory session token architecture to replace insecure email-based requests, adding brute force rate limiters, securing all admin actions, fixing password reset database sync, and implementing full SMM order placement.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Authentication Hardening**: We are replacing email-based body credentials (`adminEmail`, `email`) in authenticated API requests with a secure random `sessionToken` issued upon login. The token must be sent in the `Authorization: Bearer <token>` header.
>
> **Restarting the Server**: A server restart (`npm start`) will be required after these updates as we are modifying `server.js` and configuring a database helper.

